nemo-directory-view-ui.xml, nemo-tree-sidebar-ui.xml and nemo-style-application.css are copied unchanged from Nemo
6.6.3 (gresources/, https://github.com/linuxmint/nemo, GPL-2.0-or-later). Linux Mint 22.3 ships this version
(6.6.3+zena), and the copies are identical to the files compiled into its libnemo-extension.so.1.
tests/test_nemo_new_menu.py and tests/test_desktop_icon_labels.py check that caramos-nemo-menu changes them as
expected.
